<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     *5.25     MATURITY    20.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.825   PAY DATE  S-20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS, THEN STEPS UP TO 8.0 PCT</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
